<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1950</h1><p class="ref-lede">1950 in world history: 16 events, 12 births, 17 deaths, 6 works, 3 states founded and 6 that came to an end. 406 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
